 "html": "<b>Verdict: not reached.</b> Day 5 z500 RMSE 407 vs IFS HRES 299 on the same 12 starts (+36%); T850 2.39 vs 1.93 K (+24%). SFNO beats HRES on 2 of 9 variable\u2013lead pairs. GraphCast (non-commercial weights) is the WB2 leader at 276.",
 "stamp_html": "<h2>Run details</h2>Model: NVIDIA SFNO 73-ch (Earth2Studio 0.19.0), weights via Earth2Studio, NVIDIA licence.<br>Initial conditions and truth: ERA5 (ARCO public zarr). IFS HRES: WeatherBench2 public zarr.<br>12 starts in 2020 (WB2's test year, outside SFNO training), 00 UTC, leads 1/3/5 days, latitude-weighted RMSE at 0.25\u00b0.<br>Machine: qBraid gpu-l4 (NVIDIA L4), 1.21 s per 6 h step, model load 18.3 s.<br>Wall time 17 min \u00b7 compute cost \u2248 $0.40 \u00b7 2026-10-01.",
